# AniList OAuth Configuration
#
# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Go to https://anilist.co/settings/developer
# 2. Click "Create New Client"
# 3. Fill in the form:
#    - Name: Whatever you want (e.g., "AniList CLI")
#    - Redirect URL: http://localhost:8080/callback (exact URL is important)
# 4. Click "Save"
# 5. Copy the Client ID from the page
# 6. Paste it below
# 7. Rename this file to .env (remove the .example)
#
# Then run: cargo run

ANILIST_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
